Licenses for the vendored OpenGL loader in extern/glad/
=====================================================

extern/glad/include/glad/gl.h and extern/glad/src/gl.c were generated by
glad 2.0.8 (https://github.com/Dav1dde/glad) for the OpenGL 3.3 core profile.
extern/glad/include/KHR/khrplatform.h is the Khronos platform header that glad
ships with its output. The glad generator itself is not part of this repository.


